  "title": "Notification does not open the referenced post",
  "content": "<p>Related but different topic:<br /> </p><oembed url=\"https://community.st.com/feedback-forum-118/option-to-show-replies-chronological-166576\"></oembed><p> </p><p>I got a notification of a new post, but clicking on it didn’t bring me to the last post. I scrolled down to find the post and did not see it. I did ctrl+f to find the post by username and got the reply. It was very high in the thread. My beef is they are not chronological. But it’s also an issue that clicking on the notification did not take me to the post initially. I can’t reproduce that anymore.</p>",
